  "hook_0_to_3s": "Every time I talked to my crush, something falls from the sky. Yesterday it was a piano. It started",
  "text": "Every time I talked to my crush, something falls from the sky. Yesterday it was a piano. It started small. Hi! Gotta flower pot. Can I borrow a pencil? Gotta bathtub. Then we talked about homework for one whole minute. That was the piano. She never ran away. I almost did. The longer I talked, the bigger it gets. And I still haven't asked her out. I tried wearing three helmets. I sent my best friend to ask for me. A canoe landed on him. I called her from my bedroom. A shopping cart came through my ceiling. Two things bugged me. Right before every crash I heard a tiny bell. And everything that fell had scratch marks on it. So today I went to her house and asked anyway. Will you go out with? I heard the bell. I looked up. Her cat was on the roof pushing a car toward the edge. It had been the cat all year. She looked up too. Don't! She told the cat. I'm saying yes. The cat stared at me for a long time. Then it pushed something off the roof anyway. A rose.",
